MSC CRM v1.0
============
Date: March 6, 2026

Features:
- Kanban pipeline with 6 stages (Prep, Domain, Hosting, Collab, Theme, Launch)
- Client cards with circular progress gauges and step indicators
- Client drawer with Vault (secure credentials), Financials, Task checklist
- Fluent ecosystem communication feed
- Team Activity slide-out sidebar with dimmed backdrop
- Tactical Action Center (To-Do HUD) with task detail modals
- Studio Operations section with Pulse feed, Storage bars, FluentSupport widget
- Status bar with live metrics
- Quick Command bar
- Technical/Executive view toggle in header
- Glassmorphism UI with Electric Green (#00ff88) accents
- Vader Protocol theme: Obsidian (#121212), Charcoal (#1c1c1c)
- Subtle grid texture background
